<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41132" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισυν-άπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>join on, subjoin, attach,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					71
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.2.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Vit.</u>
				p.43
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.87
			</span></i>, etc. ; <i>add,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					1.120
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέξεις</span>]<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				6.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνάπτειν, μάχην τινί</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				14.94
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. dat.,
				<i>assist, promote,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ τάχει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					<u>Bel.</u>
					69.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>link oneself with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eustr.
					<u>in EN</u>
					6.18
				</span></i>
			.</div>
